        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "958df445-1293-3823-80e1-02db8938b832",
                "word": "chauvinisme",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ef456b4c-8b1a-4124-a78e-3cdbf8e9cbdc",
                        "entry_id": "958df445-1293-3823-80e1-02db8938b832",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "chauvinismes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5fa793c6-07de-3941-8e20-2efa1bebaddd",
                        "entry_id": "958df445-1293-3823-80e1-02db8938b832",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sentiment de celui qui est chauvin (très patriote), le comportement qui en découle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b9845d1f-89b2-4222-b29e-242358d2035d",
                                "sense_id": "5fa793c6-07de-3941-8e20-2efa1bebaddd",
                                "text": "Toutefois il nous semble qu’il entre dans les raisonnements de certains éléments intransigeants espagnols moins de raisons pratiques que de chauvinisme inquiet et que précisément ce chauvinisme ne nous est guère favorable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bd71e99-a955-4f18-91ee-0c52774da160",
                                "sense_id": "5fa793c6-07de-3941-8e20-2efa1bebaddd",
                                "text": "À l’antisémitisme politique s’associe immanquablement l’antisémitisme religieux : le chauvinisme exploite le fanatisme et le fanatisme se fait le paravent du chauvinisme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "587415bf-56bd-419f-a2a9-956e22c597a2",
                                "sense_id": "5fa793c6-07de-3941-8e20-2efa1bebaddd",
                                "text": "En même temps, les espérantophones se sentent profondément enracinés dans leur propre milieu ethnique, mais en évitant tout chauvinisme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "701fdf9e-b0fb-4a2a-87aa-7487f2217f22",
                                "sense_id": "5fa793c6-07de-3941-8e20-2efa1bebaddd",
                                "text": "Elle doit aussi compter avec un chauvinisme officiellement encouragé au Maroc sur tout débat portant sur cette région et des lois punissant les propos remettant en cause la marocanité du territoire."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "71853a80-19eb-4306-b2a8-c8387d8a9f2c",
                        "source_entry_id": "958df445-1293-3823-80e1-02db8938b832",
                        "source_sense_id": "5fa793c6-07de-3941-8e20-2efa1bebaddd",
                        "target_lang_word": "jingoism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jingoism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c81df0da-a78b-3dd8-8869-eaf84325882d",
                                        "entry_id": "8ddf0ffd-71fa-35f7-af4d-04991996f003",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excessive patriotism or aggressive nationalism, especially with regards to foreign policy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14ce4ed4-e270-4c06-8f07-3fbadcf5d528",
                                                "sense_id": "c81df0da-a78b-3dd8-8869-eaf84325882d",
                                                "text": "Soviet reports today on the British victory in the Falkland Islands said a “new flare-up of jingoism” in Britain obscured the fact that the problem was far from solved."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9606984-ee50-4f3b-a7c2-82fe2aec5892",
                                                "sense_id": "c81df0da-a78b-3dd8-8869-eaf84325882d",
                                                "text": "“When you see several dots on a page you begin to get a line of trajectory. These things mean something,” he said of the repeated displays of jingoism. “And I think what they mean is that China is back, it is powerful and it is not to be trifled with.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c2b6d31-efbf-36a2-9b0b-a2d206fa740c",
                                        "entry_id": "8ddf0ffd-71fa-35f7-af4d-04991996f003",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A jingoistic attitude, comment, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de14f5ba-b50c-402c-aa47-f0082efb9b0c",
                                                "sense_id": "9c2b6d31-efbf-36a2-9b0b-a2d206fa740c",
                                                "text": "Americans are now too overstimulated and spoiled by choices to be properly manipulated by the old rallies that used to boil nationalistic fervor—billowing flags, unctuous marching band music, and a white man in a dark suit speaking in comforting Judeo-Christian jingoisms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "569c9bd9-7dd8-40a5-ac66-7e3286c34008",
                                                "sense_id": "9c2b6d31-efbf-36a2-9b0b-a2d206fa740c",
                                                "text": "At a time when the leaders of the “free” world can run systems in an authoritarian manner, replete with their jingoisms and subtexts of internal colonialism, it is rather urgent that we demystify democratism, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20d221ef-96e1-3a7e-a329-13077c43fe88",
                                        "entry_id": "8ddf0ffd-71fa-35f7-af4d-04991996f003",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chauvinism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "81f92a4b-457b-4c64-aef3-9095d0073eeb",
                        "source_entry_id": "958df445-1293-3823-80e1-02db8938b832",
                        "source_sense_id": "5fa793c6-07de-3941-8e20-2efa1bebaddd",
